      "message": "docs(site): list every built-in post by its UI name; camcraft-kernel is the B-rep kernel seam\n\nFrom the #777 review notes: the posting page named 'Sinumerik' (the UI\nsays Siemens 840D) and left out Makera Carvera, and said the post is\nchosen per setup without the document fallback; the crate map called\ncamcraft-kernel 'shared kernel types'.\n\nRefs #688\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
